驤將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"quq_d6y_akf","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanshi-025-wangyi-4-182:a","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004","start":182,"end":186,"surface":"龍驤將軍","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004:m0186","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-025","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-025-wangyi","source_id":"s-nanshi-025-wangyi-ws12757141","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004","quote":"武帝伐廣固，仲德為前驅，戰輒破之，大小二十餘戰。盧循寇逼，眾議並欲遷都，仲德正色曰：「今天子當陽南面，明公命世作輔，新建大功，威震六合。祅寇豕突，恃我遠征，既聞凱入，將自奔散。今日投草莽則同匹夫，匹夫號令，何以威物？此謀若立，請從此辭。」帝悅。及武帝與循戰于左裏，仲德功冠諸將，封新淦縣侯。義熙十二年北伐，進仲德征虜將軍，加冀州刺史，督前鋒諸軍事。冠軍將軍檀道濟、龍驤將軍王鎮惡向洛陽，甯朔將軍劉遵考、建武將軍沈林子出石門，甯朔將軍朱超石、胡藩向半城，咸受統于仲德。仲德率龍驤將軍朱牧、甯遠將軍竺靈秀、嚴綱等開钜野入河，乃總眾軍進據潼關。長安平，以仲德為太尉諮議參軍。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004:m0186"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-song046-wangyi-ws-31-37","person_id":"quq_d6y_akf","title":"龍驤將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-song046-wangyi-ws-31-37:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p006","start":37,"end":41,"surface":"龍驤將軍","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p006:m0041","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-046","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p006","quote":"義熙十二年北伐，進仲德征虜將軍，加冀州刺史，為前鋒諸軍事。冠軍將軍檀道濟、龍驤將軍王鎮惡向洛陽，寧朔將軍劉遵考、建武將軍沈林子出石門，寧朔將軍朱超石、胡藩向半城，咸受統於仲德。仲德率龍驤將軍朱牧、寧遠將軍竺靈秀、嚴綱等開鉅野入河，乃總眾軍，進據潼關。長安平，以仲德為太尉諮議參軍。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p006:m0041"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本句所載官名，任期無確切年月。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001","text":"純字景懋，景仁弟也。劉毅鎮江陵，以爲衛軍長史、南平相。及王鎮惡襲毅，毅時病，佐史聞兵至，馳還入府，左右引車欲還外廨，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲安之。」及入，毅兵敗眾散，純爲人所殺。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"純","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0000","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝純。"},{"start":2,"end":4,"surface":"景懋","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0002","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝純。"},{"start":5,"end":7,"surface":"景仁","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0005","person_id":"684_eaa_511","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝裕。"},{"start":10,"end":12,"surface":"劉毅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0010","person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉毅。"},{"start":28,"end":31,"surface":"王鎮惡","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0028","person_id":"quq_d6y_akf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王鎮惡。"},{"start":32,"end":33,"surface":"毅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0032","person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉毅。"},{"start":34,"end":35,"surface":"毅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0034","person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉毅。"},{"start":38,"end":40,"surface":"佐史","id":"c